WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,340 --> 00:00:02,780
It would definitely be better if more people come together

2
00:00:03,940 --> 00:00:06,340
Maybe one of them has an idea for us

3
00:00:07,020 --> 00:00:10,620
But it's unlikely they'll take action against us before they crack the church.

4
00:00:12,660 --> 00:00:15,060
And our trump card is plainclothes potion

5
00:00:15,260 --> 00:00:16,860
And my holy online talent

6
00:00:17,060 --> 00:00:19,260
We have also seen how powerful the corrupt Tang Lang is.

7
00:00:19,460 --> 00:00:22,820
They are absolutely no match for me without preparation.

8
00:00:23,020 --> 00:00:26,900
Unless they have iron armor, they may be able to block Tang Lang's attack.

9
00:00:27,100 --> 00:00:31,540
Buhan, you little brat

10
00:00:31,740 --> 00:00:32,930
Right, right, right

11
00:00:33,580 --> 00:00:35,180
Why is this old woman still here?

12
00:00:35,580 --> 00:00:36,780
So persistent

13
00:00:40,260 --> 00:00:41,260
Okay, let's go

14
00:00:41,460 --> 00:00:43,060
The other two groups must have already set off.
